---
// HomeHero.astro - Hero éditorial clarifiant les 3 propositions fondamentales
---

<section class="pt-2 sm:pt-6 pb-12 sm:pb-16 border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <!-- En-tête principal -->
  <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center">
    
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col">
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-400 mb-2.5">
        Lyon 4<sup>e</sup> (Croix-Rousse) &bull; Christophe Desmur
      </p>

      <h1
        id="hero-title"
        class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-serif font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-950 dark:text-white leading-[1.12]">
        Calligraphie chinoise à Lyon
      </h1>

      <p class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif italic text-indigo-900 dark:text-indigo-300 mt-2">
        L'art du pinceau, du souffle et de l'encre de Chine
      </p>

      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 font-serif mt-4 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        Christophe Desmur pratique et transmet la calligraphie chinoise depuis plus de 30 ans, à travers des cours réguliers, des ateliers culturels et la création d'œuvres originales.
      </p>

      <!-- Reassurance discrète -->
      <div class="mt-4 flex items-center flex-wrap gap-x-3.5 gap-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-sans">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 text-xs font-bold" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
          <span>Transmission traditionnelle</span>
        </span>
        <span class="text-gray-300 dark:text-gray-600 hidden sm:inline" aria-hidden="true">•</span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 text-xs font-bold" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
          <span>Débutants bienvenus</span>
        </span>
        <span class="text-gray-300 dark:text-gray-600 hidden sm:inline" aria-hidden="true">•</span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 text-xs font-bold" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
          <span>Pièces originales uniques</span>
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Visuel d'ambiance : Le geste au pinceau -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative mt-4 lg:mt-0">
      <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-md lg:max-w-none">
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-xs bg-white dark:bg-gray-800">
          <img
            src="/assets/personne-realisant-de-la-calligraphie-avec-un-pinceau-sur-du-papier.webp"
            alt="Christophe Desmur pratiquant la calligraphie chinoise au pinceau sur papier de riz à Lyon"
            width="600"
            height="420"
            loading="eager"
            fetchpriority="high"
            decoding="async"
            class="w-full h-auto object-cover"
          />
          <div class="p-3 bg-stone-50/90 dark:bg-stone-900/90 text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 border-t border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 flex justify-between items-center font-serif">
            <span>Le geste de l'encre & la tenue du pinceau</span>
            <span class="text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-500">Lyon Croix-Rousse</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <!-- LES 3 VOIES D'ACCÈS PRINCIPALES (Apprendre, Expérimenter, Acquérir)-->
  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <div class="mt-12 sm:mt-16">
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-6 sm:mb-8">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400">
        Trois approches de la voie du pinceau
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-serif font-medium text-gray-950 dark:text-gray-100 mt-1">
        Que souhaitez-vous explorer ?
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      
      <!-- 1. APPRENDRE -->
      <div class="group bg-white dark:bg-gray-800/90 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 border border-gray-200/90 dark:border-gray-700/80 shadow-2xs hover:shadow-md hover:border-indigo-300 dark:hover:border-indigo-800 transition flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-400">
              Apprendre
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500">Particuliers</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-medium text-gray-950 dark:text-gray-100 group-hover:text-indigo-600 dark:group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">
            Cours de calligraphie
          </h3>

          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 font-serif mt-2.5 leading-relaxed">
            Cours collectifs hebdomadaires à Lyon 4<sup>e</sup> (Croix-Rousse) et cours individuels sur mesure à votre domicile.
          </p>

          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 font-sans border-t border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700/60 pt-3">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">&bull; Petits groupes de 2 à 8 élèves</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">&bull; Débutants bienvenus toute l'année</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">&bull; Matériel fourni sur place</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700/70">
          <a
            href="#cours"
            class="w-full py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl bg-gray-950 hover:bg-gray-800 text-white dark:bg-gray-100 dark:text-gray-950 dark:hover:bg-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition text-center inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-indigo-500">
            <span>Découvrir les cours</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. EXPÉRIMENTER -->
      <div class="group bg-white dark:bg-gray-800/90 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 border border-gray-200/90 dark:border-gray-700/80 shadow-2xs hover:shadow-md hover:border-indigo-300 dark:hover:border-indigo-800 transition flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-400">
              Expérimenter
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500">Structures & Groupes</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-medium text-gray-950 dark:text-gray-100 group-hover:text-indigo-600 dark:group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">
            Ateliers de calligraphie
          </h3>

          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 font-serif mt-2.5 leading-relaxed">
            Interventions culturelles et pédagogiques sur site pour les écoles, lycées, universités, entreprises (CSE) et EHPAD.
          </p>

          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 font-sans border-t border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700/60 pt-3">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">&bull; Séances de 1 h à 3 h sur votre site</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">&bull; Découverte de l'encre & du Sumi-e</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">&bull; Tout le matériel transporté par le calligraphe</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700/70">
          <a
            href="#ateliers"
            class="w-full py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-stone-50 hover:bg-stone-100 dark:bg-gray-800/80 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition text-center inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-indigo-500">
            <span>Organiser un atelier</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. ACQUÉRIR / COLLECTIONNER -->
      <div class="group bg-white dark:bg-gray-800/90 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 border border-gray-200/90 dark:border-gray-700/80 shadow-2xs hover:shadow-md hover:border-indigo-300 dark:hover:border-indigo-800 transition flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-400">
              Acquérir
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500">Galerie d'art</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-medium text-gray-950 dark:text-gray-100 group-hover:text-indigo-600 dark:group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">
            Calligraphies originales
          </h3>

          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 font-serif mt-2.5 leading-relaxed">
            Découvrez des pièces uniques à l'encre de Chine signées et scellées par Christophe Desmur, disponibles à l'acquisition directe.
          </p>

          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 font-sans border-t border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700/60 pt-3">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">&bull; Pièces uniques sur papier de riz</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">&bull; Contact direct avec le calligraphe</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">&bull; Remise à Lyon ou expédition protégée</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700/70">
          <a
            href="#galerie-preview"
            class="w-full py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-stone-50 hover:bg-stone-100 dark:bg-gray-800/80 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition text-center inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-indigo-500">
            <span>Voir les œuvres</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
